Inside it, keep lines 117–270 verbatim (state, `markIdle`, `failAllPending`, `dropPendingChunks`, `pushRpcChunk`, `handleLine`). Replace the `const socket = await Bun.connect({ … })` block and the `writer` line (272–306) with:

